Third-party data in this repository

City data: GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org
License: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: selection, name normalization.

IP-to-city data: IP Geolocation by DB-IP, https://db-ip.com
Database "IP to City Lite", license: CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Unmodified. The file is not in the repository: the server reads it from API_IPGEO_DB
(backend/internal/platform/ipgeo). The test database backend/internal/platform/ipgeo/testdata/city-test.mmdb
contains fictional data in the same format (generator backend/tools/ipgeofixture), no DB-IP data.
